{"version":"1.0","encoding":"UTF-8","feed":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom","xmlns$openSearch":"http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/","xmlns$blogger":"http://schemas.google.com/blogger/2008","xmlns$georss":"http://www.georss.org/georss","xmlns$gd":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005","xmlns$thr":"http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0","id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-473881310042607794"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-10-20T23:50:20.326+01:00"},"category":[{"term":"Daisaku Ikeda"},{"term":"Ikeda"},{"term":"Nichiren"},{"term":"President Ikeda"},{"term":"SGI"},{"term":"chapter study"},{"term":"peace"},{"term":"study"},{"term":"taplow"},{"term":"ywd"},{"term":"2011"},{"term":"August 2011"},{"term":"Brunel University"},{"term":"Buddhist"},{"term":"Carlos Rubio"},{"term":"Christian"},{"term":"Dennis Gira"},{"term":"Hiroshima"},{"term":"Jim Garrison"},{"term":"Josei Toda"},{"term":"Kosen-rufu"},{"term":"London"},{"term":"London Centres"},{"term":"Myoho-renge-kyo"},{"term":"NL8226SM"},{"term":"Nagasaki"},{"term":"New Year's message"},{"term":"SGI President Ikeda"},{"term":"SGI-UK"},{"term":"Sensei"},{"term":"Soka Gakkai"},{"term":"WD"},{"term":"West London Area"},{"term":"accessible"},{"term":"anti-nuclear"},{"term":"atomic bombings"},{"term":"buddhism"},{"term":"earthquake"},{"term":"encouragement"},{"term":"free admission"},{"term":"future group"},{"term":"guidance"},{"term":"hope"},{"term":"introduction to buddhism"},{"term":"japan times"},{"term":"kayo kai"},{"term":"leaders"},{"term":"life force"},{"term":"newsletter"},{"term":"recent events"},{"term":"renewal"},{"term":"revitalization"},{"term":"summer course"},{"term":"the selection of the time"},{"term":"voice"},{"term":"wisdom of the Lotus Sutra"},{"term":"words"},{"term":"youth division"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"brilliant brent east buddhists"},"subtitle":{"type":"html","$t":"information that may prove interesting and\/or useful to SGI buddhists, \nespecially those in Brent"},"link":[{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https:\/\/brilliantbrenteastbuddhists.blogspot.com\/feeds\/posts\/default"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https:\/\/www.blogger.com\/feeds\/473881310042607794\/posts\/default?alt=json\u0026max-results=1"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https:\/\/brilliantbrenteastbuddhists.blogspot.com\/"},{"rel":"hub","href":"http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"},{"rel":"next","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https:\/\/www.blogger.com\/feeds\/473881310042607794\/posts\/default?alt=json\u0026start-index=2\u0026max-results=1"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Lostinadarkwood"},"uri":{"$t":"http:\/\/www.blogger.com\/profile\/18444315236180769129"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","height":"16","src":"https:\/\/img1.blogblog.com\/img\/b16-rounded.gif"}}],"generator":{"version":"7.00","uri":"http://www.blogger.com","$t":"Blogger"},"openSearch$totalResults":{"$t":"5510"},"openSearch$startIndex":{"$t":"1"},"openSearch$itemsPerPage":{"$t":"1"},"entry":[{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-473881310042607794.post-2226995984336742955"},"published":{"$t":"2026-10-20T23:50:20.326+01:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-10-20T23:50:20.326+01:00"},"title":{"type":"text","$t":"Sensei's Daily Encouragement -October 21 2026- Year of Vibrant Growth for a Youthful Soka Gakkai Worldwide"},"content":{"type":"html","$t":"\u003Cdiv class=\"ydp3a3c8adyahoo-style-wrap\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"\u003E\n \u003Cdiv dir=\"ltr\" data-setdir=\"false\"\u003E\n  \u003Cdiv dir=\"ltr\" data-setdir=\"false\"\u003E\n   \u003Cbr style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"\u003E\n   \u003Cdiv dir=\"ltr\" data-setdir=\"false\"\u003E\n    \u003Cdiv\u003E\n     \u003Cdiv class=\"ydpc74b842pasted-link\"\u003E\n      \u003Cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color:#000080;\"\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDaily Encouragement by Daisaku Ikeda\u003C\/strong\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n         October 21, 2026\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n         The mentality of getting others to do the hard work while one sits back and takes it easy - that is bureaucratism at its worst; it is not faith. The spirit of taking on the hard work oneself - that is faith, that is humanism.\u003Cbr\u003E\n         ________________________________\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFrom the Writings of Nichiren Daishonin\u003C\/strong\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n         October 21, 2026\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n         The mighty warrior General Li Kuang, whose mother had been devoured by a tiger, shot an arrow at the stone he believed was the tiger. The arrow penetrated the stone all the way up to its feathers. But once he realised it was only a stone he was unable to pierce it again. Later he came to be known as General Stone Tiger. This story applies to you. Though enemies lurk in wait for you, your resolute faith in the Lotus Sutra has forestalled great dangers before they could begin. Realising this, you must strengthen your faith more than ever.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe Writings of Nichiren Daishonin, page 953\u003C\/strong\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n         General Stone Tiger\u003Cbr\u003E\n         Written to Shijo Kingo on October 22, 1278\u003Cbr\u003E\n         ________________________________\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWisdom for Modern Life by Daisaku Ikeda\u003C\/strong\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n         October 21, 2026\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n         Our lives grow to the degree that we give hope and courage to others and enable them to develop their lives. Therefore, while we speak of practicing Buddhism for others, it is we ourselves who ultimately benefit. With this understanding comes the ability to take action with a sense of appreciation.\u003Cbr\u003E\n         ________________________________\u003C\/span\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color:#006400;\"\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EExcerpt from Daisaku Ikeda - A Youthful Diary (10 November 1955) p.271\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\/strong\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n         Everyone has periods when things go well and times when they aren’t so smooth. But such distinctions disappear when a person is truly strong and capable.\u003Cbr\u003E\n         …\u003Cbr\u003E\n         At night, I composed a poem titled “Human Revolution”:\u003Cbr\u003E\n         …\u003Cbr\u003E\n         Beginningless voyage of life,\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n         Eternal motion of the macrocosm,\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n         As the morning sun soars into the sky,\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n         Life stirs anew among the buds.\u003Cbr\u003E\n         \u0026nbsp;\u003Cbr\u003E\n         The power of myoho, fundamental force of nature,\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n         Strong enough to shatter boulders,\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n         Or dispel the darkness of our evil karma.\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color:#006400\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-size:16px\"\u003E____________________________\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n      \u003Cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n      \u003Cblockquote type=\"cite\"\u003E\u003C\/blockquote\u003E\u003Cbr data-cke-eol=\"1\"\u003E\n     \u003C\/div\u003E\u003Cbr style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"\u003E\n    \u003C\/div\u003E\n   \u003C\/div\u003E\n  \u003C\/div\u003E\n \u003C\/div\u003E\n\u003C\/div\u003E\n"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https:\/\/brilliantbrenteastbuddhists.blogspot.com\/feeds\/2226995984336742955\/comments\/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https:\/\/brilliantbrenteastbuddhists.blogspot.com\/2026\/10\/senseis-daily-encouragement-october-21.html#comment-form","title":"0 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https:\/\/www.blogger.com\/feeds\/473881310042607794\/posts\/default\/2226995984336742955"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https:\/\/www.blogger.com\/feeds\/473881310042607794\/posts\/default\/2226995984336742955"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https:\/\/brilliantbrenteastbuddhists.blogspot.com\/2026\/10\/senseis-daily-encouragement-october-21.html","title":"Sensei's Daily Encouragement -October 21 2026- Year of Vibrant Growth for a Youthful Soka Gakkai Worldwide"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Lostinadarkwood"},"uri":{"$t":"http:\/\/www.blogger.com\/profile\/18444315236180769129"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","height":"16","src":"https:\/\/img1.blogblog.com\/img\/b16-rounded.gif"}}],"thr$total":{"$t":"0"}}]}}